{
 "_about": "Adapted for Concepts (vector sketching, diagrams). Themes reviews.py sorts feedback into. Patterns are Python regular expressions, matched case-insensitively against the review text. kind is complaint (something users hate) or request (something users want that is missing). Edit freely: add the app category's own words (for a booking app: double booking, time zone, no-show).",
